{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_08_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2d6ef78177ee9491c50846307bd95393888dd4e7e64de98ddbf62cbb4a0bab31",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3aab900f87083af6090ac47214011cd8a1d82ffb4eacbe60c1790dbf58616830",
      "text": "厄运也是幸运！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ba886fc2f5a625f776ea6d3c65ddf89cee4fa900d14252193e93bb16944f816",
      "text": "FRAME决定出战男极“力量部门”。\n在Cafe Parade的慰劳品支持下，\n他们挺过了诚司的特训，终于迎来了正式演出的\n舞台，然而在前往会场的途中，\n被告知的消息却是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000038:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80e498f00eddab0e29051b175768d604c18ab0086fada3bff7c892660c85b4f1",
      "text": "第8话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000038:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3aab900f87083af6090ac47214011cd8a1d82ffb4eacbe60c1790dbf58616830",
      "text": "厄运也是幸运！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a49eed001defc7aff1a5242ec72a72f0c68fd3abfa8a50593a213d2ba44b8ec9",
      "text": "今天的特训到此为止！解散！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b576f1ced2cf9e8e206f4a4ba365e263bc7f6b6137efc0191dec7a32d35f1d27",
      "text": "谢谢……指导……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c11e637b7f7001b4181ddca31c06015cffb34b95739bb3d10b8ae42c6d5eb5de",
      "text": "照这个状态下去，当天在“力量部门”里，\n说不定能连续唱上3个小时呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:affd1c87376fc361d6958d1000db21b51d26a027dac0c7c22308fd93a74d1883",
      "text": "哈、哈哈……啊，是啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27daf12ead3afc485bd695fc41aceb6686f18b831a28dac5e641411df7c5d707",
      "text": "作为我们的对手登上舞台的，\n是来自全国各地自夸力气大的偶像们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da926b2d7e3b0ff81ab778056ed4576a84d088ae0dcd424c0415f0113b3db992",
      "text": "为了能在他们当中拔得头筹，\n必须比平时练出更多的力量才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e54b74f419daaa42b1cb0387479fb3471c5c0403c8c6b48523379b79a3bbe7d1",
      "text": "自从开始接受诚司先生的斯巴达特训，\n感觉体力确实比以前好了不少……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c6e43bc6ed829fe9607b3e7c40822673759737e8c392e1a29b24783b0a4d735",
      "text": "这样下去的话，拿第一也不是梦！\n当然，还有315 Pro的目标——男极KING也是……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000162:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60ce2463a3ffc982484e66e3e0d61d489ca356b6adb3d076374103b5a9ea6c1f",
      "text": "呜呜，肚子饿瘪了～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec24454ccc165116b3fa36d7e976578d7d7d677d588af0432c28889e494e0e83",
      "text": "今天也是从早到晚\n排得满满当当的课程呢。我也饿扁了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_a:cmd-000189:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8343a186b3f9a1c505cec7b478a7ee70a463ee71743d42ffa1f8310276488f65",
      "text": "FRAME的各位！\n训练辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
